Enna Sona Guitar Chords with strumming pattern from Bollywood Hindi movie OK Jaanu sung by Arijit Singh. Lead roles are Shraddha Kapoor and Aditya Roy Kapur.

Strumming Pattern: DU U DU

Capo on: 3rd fret

If you want to play without capo please replace

Em = Gm

D = F

C = D

G = A

Bm = C#m

